Subject: [PATCH] Extended View Distance fixes


diff --git a/src/main/java/org/bukkit/entity/Player.java b/src/main/java/org/bukkit/entity/Player.java
index af474b6feb33b2ba624ff98d9b4b7131617986eb..9ac230f9307c5abf8bd49695b31a3d6f41d1726d 100644
